y":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T06:07:40-07:00","id":457966,"title":"","content":"Wow. Fade to black on the first run... That's rough. Did you at least hear about the aftermath?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4563-terraben","name":"TerraBen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T06:42:58-07:00","id":458003,"title":"","content":"We've had a couple games now but only one Sacred Hunt.<br /> <br /> It went very smoothly. I wouldn't say it was anticlimactic but we weren't used to the new power our forms held, so the killing was over in two rolls. He was running, it was a human, and I used urshul to inflict leg wrack, but the attack itself did somewhere around 4 aggravated, since I was eating for Essence, having been brought low using gifts earlier and in the previous session. So we ruled that it essentially just ate the leg. <br /> <br /> We're definitely going to have to aim higher next time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-06-2015, 09:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T07:29:01-07:00","id":458046,"title":"","content":"How did your breaking point go after eating his leg?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/